      "statement": "A synchronous declarative subagent is isolated by default: it receives a new task message and state with messages, todos, structured response, skill metadata, pinned skills, disclosure metadata, fork marker, and private fields excluded; explicit child permissions or `interrupt_on` replace inherited values, while omitted values inherit the parent configuration.",
